	(text "L1 10 µH + C4 / C5, with C2 on +24V: pi filter in front of the DC/DC only.\nRelay contacts, INA226s and sensors use the unfiltered +24V.\nU1 URB2405S-6WR3 (as on the MES4-Flasher): 9-36 V in, 5 V 1.2 A, short-circuit protected.\nCTRL open = on. C5 = the maker's 100 µF input cap; C6 / C7 = output caps.\nThe maker's EMC circuit adds a 470 µH common-mode choke + 1 nF Y caps: not fitted, because\nNT1 ties the grounds (the 1.5 kV isolation is not used). The maker lists hot-plug as unsupported:\nL1 slows the inrush into C5; Q1 / D9 / C1 take the XT30 plug-in.\nLoad: module ≤ 240 mA + 4 coils 285 mA + 2 winch coils 56 mA + load cell 13 mA ≈ 0.6 A (50 %)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 157.48 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "a9879d3a-6e37-5259-94f5-e1a12f1bdf02")
	)
