	(text "F2 1.1 A PTC: the fuse per module slot (CIF rule 4).\nFB1 + C8 / C9: pi filter, so relay-coil switching on\n+5V_24 stays off the module and the load-cell excitation.\n+5V → module fingers 20 / 22 (4.75-5.5 V, CIF rule 2) and the\nADS1232 AVDD (LoadCell sheet). Place C8 / C9 at the socket."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 160.02 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
